cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If DiagHam contributes to your work, please cite it as software using the
  metadata below, and cite the papers relevant to the methods you used from
  the DiagHam publication list (https://www.nick-ux.org/diagham/index.php/Articles).
  DiagHam has no single reference paper.
title: DiagHam
type: software
abstract: >-
  Exact-diagonalization toolkit for strongly correlated quantum systems:
  fractional quantum Hall effect, fractional Chern and topological
  insulators, Hubbard models, spin chains and quantum dots.
authors:
